    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "How to use",
      "pos": [
        -1900,
        -340
      ],
      "size": [
        780,
        210
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "text": "CHANGE VOICE (CosyVoice 3 native voice conversion) — keeps the words and the delivery, swaps only the timbre.\n\n1. Upload the speech you want re-voiced (any length) to 'Source speech'. It is auto-split into <=25s chunks, re-voiced, and stitched back, so length is unlimited.\n2. Upload a SHORT clean clip (3-30s) of the target speaker to 'Target voice'. Keep it SHORT (<=30s).\n3. Run, listen in 'Save audio'.\n\nThis is REAL voice conversion — no transcription step, so pauses, emphasis and pacing survive intact.\n\nTo generate NEW speech from typed text instead, use the 'Voice Clone' workflow.\n\nFirst run downloads the CosyVoice model (~GB) — give it a few minutes.\n\n⚠️ Predefined example — it resets to the original every GPU start; edits here are lost. Save under a NEW name (Save As) to keep your own copy; custom workflows persist between sessions."
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "CHANGE VOICE (CosyVoice 3 native voice conversion) — keeps the words and the delivery, swaps only the timbre.\n\n1. Upload the speech you want re-voiced (any length) to 'Source speech'. It is auto-split into <=25s chunks, re-voiced, and stitched back, so length is unlimited.\n2. Upload a SHORT clean clip (3-30s) of the target speaker to 'Target voice'. Keep it SHORT (<=30s).\n3. Run, listen in 'Save audio'.\n\nThis is REAL voice conversion — no transcription step, so pauses, emphasis and pacing survive intact.\n\nTo generate NEW speech from typed text instead, use the 'Voice Clone' workflow.\n\nFirst run downloads the CosyVoice model (~GB) — give it a few minutes.\n\n⚠️ Predefined example — it resets to the original every GPU start; edits here are lost. Save under a NEW name (Save As) to keep your own copy; custom workflows persist between sessions."
      ],
      "color": "#333",
      "bgcolor": "#444"
    },
